msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:65
msgid "包管理基础"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:67
msgid "Debian系用 `apt` 管理软件包。以下命令能覆盖90%的日常需求："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:69
msgid ""
"# 更新软件源（换源后或首次使用必须执行）\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"\n"
"# 升级所有已安装的包\n"
"sudo apt upgrade\n"
"\n"
"# 安装软件（以安装Python为例）\n"
"sudo apt install python3 python3-pip\n"
"\n"
"# 卸载软件\n"
"sudo apt remove python3\n"
"\n"
"# 搜索软件\n"
"apt search nvidia-driver\n"
"\n"
"# 查看已安装的包\n"
"apt list --installed | grep nvidia\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:89
msgid "为什么要 sudo？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:92
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"普通用户没有权限安装系统级软件。`sudo` 让你临时以root身份执行命令（{ref}`user-"
"permissions`会详细讲用户和权限）。首次使用 `sudo` "
"时需要输入当前用户的密码——注意：**终端输入密码时不会显示任何字符（不回显）。** 这是正常行为，输完按回车就行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:95
msgid ""
"一个常见的陷阱：**不要用 `sudo pip "
"install`**。这会把Python包装到系统目录，和apt管理的包冲突。正确的做法是用虚拟环境隔离项目依赖。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:97
msgid "uv：现代Python包管理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:99
msgid ""
"传统上Python用 `pip` 装包、`venv` 管环境、`pip-tools` 管依赖锁定——三个工具各管一事。**uv** "
"是一个用Rust写的Python包管理器，把这套东西全包了，而且快了一个数量级："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:101
msgid ""
"# 安装uv\n"
"curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh\n"
"\n"
"# 创建虚拟环境并激活\n"
"uv venv\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"\n"
"# 安装包（自动创建虚拟环境，无需手动 venv + activate）\n"
"uv pip install torch torchvision\n"
"\n"
"# 从 requirements.txt 安装\n"
"uv pip install -r requirements.txt\n"
"\n"
"# 锁定依赖版本（生成 uv.lock）\n"
"uv pip compile requirements.txt -o requirements.txt.lock\n"
"\n"
"# 根据 lock 文件安装（保证团队环境一致）\n"
"uv pip sync requirements.txt.lock\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:122
msgid "pip + venv vs uv"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:125
msgid "**操作**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:126
msgid "**pip + venv**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:127
msgid "**uv**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:128
msgid "创建环境"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:129
msgid "`python3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:130
msgid "`uv venv`（自动激活）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:131
msgid "安装依赖"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:132
msgid "`pip install -r requirements.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:133
msgid "`uv pip install -r requirements.txt`（快10-100倍）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:134
msgid "依赖解析"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:135
msgid "无内置，需 `pip-tools`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:136
msgid "内置 `uv pip compile`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:137
msgid "Python版本管理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:138
msgid "手动安装不同版本"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:139
msgid "`uv python install 3.12`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:140
msgid "底层语言"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:141
msgid "Python"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:142
msgid "Rust（无GIL，全局解释器锁问题）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:145
msgid ""
"最重要的优势是**速度**和**确定性**：`uv pip compile` 会解析出完整的依赖树并锁定版本，你和队友拿到同一个 lock "
"文件安装出来的环境完全一致，不会出现\"我机器上能跑你机器上报错\"的情况。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:147
msgid "uv 和 conda 的关系"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:150
msgid ""
"uv 不管理非Python包（如CUDA驱动、系统库）。如果你需要 conda 那种跨语言包管理（Python + C++库 + "
"系统工具），可以继续用 conda 或 mamba。但纯Python依赖管理，uv 是更好的选择。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:153
msgid "系统管理基础"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:155
msgid "systemd：管理服务"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:157
msgid "深度学习服务器上，很多组件（SSH、Docker、监控）都是作为系统服务运行的。systemd是管理这些服务的标准工具："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:159
msgid ""
"# 查看服务状态\n"
"systemctl status sshd\n"
"\n"
"# 启动/停止/重启服务\n"
"sudo systemctl start sshd\n"
"sudo systemctl stop sshd\n"
"sudo systemctl restart sshd\n"
"\n"
"# 设置开机自启\n"
"sudo systemctl enable sshd\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:174
msgid "用户和权限"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:176
msgid ""
"# 创建新用户\n"
"sudo adduser alice\n"
"\n"
"# 给用户sudo权限\n"
"sudo usermod -aG sudo alice\n"
"\n"
"# 切换用户\n"
"su - alice\n"
"\n"
"# 修改文件/目录所有者\n"
"sudo chown alice:alice /data/datasets\n"
"\n"
"# 修改权限（r=4, w=2, x=1）\n"
"chmod 755 script.sh    # 所有者可读写执行，其他人可读执行\n"
"chmod 600 id_rsa       # 私钥文件必须600权限，否则SSH会报错\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:194
msgid "磁盘和存储"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:196
msgid "训练数据集动辄几十GB，了解磁盘使用情况是常备技能："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:198
msgid ""
"# 查看磁盘分区和使用情况\n"
"df -h\n"
"\n"
"# 查看当前目录下各子目录的大小\n"
"du -sh *\n"
"\n"
"# 查看当前目录总大小\n"
"du -sh .\n"
"\n"
"# 挂载新硬盘\n"
"sudo mount /dev/sdb1 /mnt/data\n"
"\n"
"# 开机自动挂载（编辑 /etc/fstab）\n"
"# UUID=xxxx-xxxx  /mnt/data  ext4  defaults  0  2\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:215
msgid "进程管理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:217
msgid "训练一个模型通常要跑几小时甚至几天，掌握进程管理能帮你避免\"训练跑了一半终端关了\"的惨案："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:219
#, python-format
msgid ""
"# 查看所有进程\n"
"ps aux\n"
"\n"
"# 按CPU或内存排序\n"
"ps aux --sort=-%cpu\n"
"ps aux --sort=-%mem\n"
"\n"
"# 实时监控（类似任务管理器）\n"
"htop\n"
"\n"
"# 终止进程\n"
"kill -9 PID\n"
"\n"
"# 让进程在退出终端后继续运行\n"
"nohup python train.py > train.log 2>&1 &\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:237
msgid "nohup 和 tmux 的选择"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:240
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`nohup` 是最简单的后台运行方式，但管理多个进程不方便。生产环境建议用 tmux（{ref}`tmux-"
"basics`会详细介绍），它让你能创建多个终端会话，随时断开和重新连接。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:245
msgid "SSH：远程连接服务器"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:247
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"深度学习服务器很少在你手边——可能在机房，可能在云上。SSH是你和服务器之间的桥梁。本节讲基础配置，{ref}`ssh-"
"tunnel`会深入到端口转发等高级用法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:249
msgid "密钥认证（推荐，不要用密码）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:251
msgid ""
"# 在本地机器上生成密钥对\n"
"# -t rsa: 算法类型\n"
"# -b 4096: 密钥长度\n"
"# -C \"注释，通常是邮箱\"\n"
"ssh-keygen -t rsa -b 4096 -C \"your@email.com\"\n"
"\n"
"# 查看公钥内容（把这个给服务器管理员）\n"
"cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub\n"
"\n"
"# 将公钥复制到服务器（如果有密码权限）\n"
"ssh-copy-id user@your-server-ip\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:265
msgid "为什么要用密钥而不是密码？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:268
msgid "密码认证有两个大问题：一是弱密码容易被暴力破解（服务器放在公网上半小时内就会收到扫描）；二是每次登录都要输入密码。密钥认证用一对公钥-私钥文件代替了密码输入，私钥存在本地，别人拿不到就不可能登录你的服务器。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:271
msgid "SSH配置文件"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:273
msgid "`~/.ssh/config` 可以让你不用每次都输入完整的连接信息："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:275
msgid ""
"# ~/.ssh/config\n"
"Host gpu-server\n"
"    HostName 123.123.123.123\n"
"    User anson\n"
"    Port 22\n"
"    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa\n"
"\n"
"Host lab-machine\n"
"    HostName 192.168.1.100\n"
"    User alice\n"
"    Port 2222\n"
"\n"
"# 配置好后就可以用短名称连接了\n"
"# ssh gpu-server   # 等价于 ssh anson@123.123.123.123 -p 22 -i ~/.ssh/id_rsa"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:292
msgid "安全加固"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:294
msgid "服务器放在公网上不需要太多配置，但以下几个措施值得做："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:296
msgid ""
"# 1. 禁止root直接登录\n"
"# 编辑 /etc/ssh/sshd_config\n"
"PermitRootLogin no\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 禁止密码认证\n"
"PasswordAuthentication no\n"
"\n"
"# 3. 修改默认端口（减少被扫描的概率）\n"
"Port 2222\n"
"\n"
"# 修改后重启SSH服务\n"
"sudo systemctl restart sshd\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:311
msgid "别把自己锁在外面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:314
msgid "修改SSH配置前，确保你已经用**另一个终端窗口**测试过新配置能连上。如果配错了把自己锁在外面，就只能去机房或者找运维帮忙了。测试方法：新开一个终端，用新的配置尝试连接，确认能登录后再关掉旧的窗口。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:317
msgid "常用命令速查"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:311
msgid "命令"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:311
msgid "作用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:311
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/linux-basics.md:311
msgid "`ls -lh`"
